- **Symptom:** External HTTP GET to acm.org (198.82.0.1) returns 503.
- **Cause:** Local overload — 5 `while true` shells spawning `curl --max-time 120 .../slow` requests (10 processes in total counting curl children) are tying up the server's tiny connection backlog. Network path is healthy.
